- ## rudiments
+ ## rudiments

- - The `each` and `all` extensions whose receiver was a `scala.Iterator` are removed: the
-   iterator's own `each`/`all` methods take their place. The `Traversable` extensions (`each`,
-   `all`, `fuse`, `seek`, `reap`, `sweep`, `where`, `indexed`, `head`, `last`, `lead`,
-   `leading`, `trailing`, `locate`, `total`, `product`, `reduce`, `occupied`) are unchanged in
-   signature but now drive `murmuration.Iterator`. `sorted` and `ordered` on an iterator take it
-   as `consume`. (#2235)
+ - Les extensions `each` et `all` dont le receveur était un `scala.Iterator` sont supprimées : les
+   méthodes `each`/`all` propres à l'itérateur les remplacent. Les extensions de `Traversable`
+   (`each`, `all`, `fuse`, `seek`, `reap`, `sweep`, `where`, `indexed`, `head`, `last`, `lead`,
+   `leading`, `trailing`, `locate`, `total`, `product`, `reduce`, `occupied`) ont une signature
+   inchangée mais pilotent désormais `murmuration.Iterator`. `sorted` et `ordered` sur un itérateur
+   le prennent en `consume`. (#2235)

